            "review_title": "Review at Banh Duc Nom",
            "review_text": "Star N Nick T\nRome, Italy4 contributions\n0\nSooo yummy\nMay 2023 • Family\nThe best banh duc!!! I don’t think we have any in Texas. The owner is real sweet and friendly. We only got to try the hot one. The room temp one has peanuts and we’re allergic to peanuts so unable to try. We are a family of 6 and we all had to squeeze in and squat to eat which was fun for them to learn. Will def come back and see her next time.\nWritten May 29, 2023",
