            "review_text": "Lerne S\n5 contributions\n0\nBanh Duc Nom\nDec 2017 • Friends\nCake casting fragrant chan chan hot meat. Sautéed fennel ear & purple onion should be fragrant that chewy crispy crispy. Add chopped coriander leaves, chili powder and less garlic vinegar to go flying bowl.\nCasters here are delicious too. But the super-product of the winter is hot cast cake. It's great to enjoy this dish.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 28, 2018",
